[
  {
    "type": "effect_on_condition",
    "id": "EOC_HENTAI_WET_DREAM",
    "eoc_type": "EVENT",
    "required_event": "character_wakes_up",
    "condition": {
      "and": [
        "u_is_avatar",
        { "math": [ "HENTAI_EXTEND_WET_DREAM" ] },
        { "not": { "u_has_effect": "nightmares" } },
        { "math": [ "time_since(hentai_wet_dream_slept_time) > time('1 h')" ] }
      ]
    },
    "effect":[
      {
        "switch": { "math": [ "u_effect_intensity('corrupt')" ] },
        "cases": [
          { "case": 0, "effect": { "set_string_var": "<wet_dream_normal>", "target_var": { "context_val": "msg" }, "parse_tags": true } },
          { "case": 3, "effect": { "set_string_var": "<wet_dream_corrupt_3>", "target_var": { "context_val": "msg" }, "parse_tags": true } },
          { "case": 6, "effect": { "set_string_var": "<wet_dream_corrupt_6>", "target_var": { "context_val": "msg" }, "parse_tags": true } }
        ] 
      },
      { "math": [ "_chance", "=", "u_effect_intensity('corrupt') * 15 + ( u_effect_intensity('estrus') > 0 ? 30 : 0 ) + 1" ] },
      {
        "if": { "math": [ "rand(99) < _chance" ] },
        "then": [
          { "u_message": { "context_val":"msg" }, "type": "mixed" },
          { "map_spawn_item": "h_body_fluids" }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "effect_on_condition",
    "id": "EOC_HENTAI_WET_DREAM_SET_SLEEP_TIME",
    "eoc_type": "EVENT",
    "required_event": "character_gains_effect",
    "condition": {
      "and": [
        "u_is_avatar",
        { "compare_string": [ "sleep", { "context_val": "effect" } ] }
      ]
    },
    "effect": [ { "math": [ "hentai_wet_dream_slept_time = time('now')" ] } ]
  },
  {
    "type": "snippet",
    "category": "<wet_dream_normal>",
    "text": [
      "...怎么感觉大腿附近湿湿的。",
      "...看来是做了个色色的梦。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "snippet",
    "category": "<wet_dream_corrupt_3>",
    "text": [
      "<wet_dream_normal>",
      "睡着的时候好像高潮了。但身体的燥热还是没有消退。",
      "难得做了个舒服的梦，却醒了过来。",
      "睡着的时候被好几名梦魔包围，无法抵抗...看来是梦啊。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "snippet",
    "category": "<wet_dream_corrupt_6>",
    "text": [
      "看来是在睡梦中高潮了。但身体的燥热却无法平息。",
      "难得做了个舒服的梦，却醒了过来。",
      "睡梦中被好几名梦魔包围，无法抵抗地被侵犯，高潮了一次又一次...看来是梦，真可惜。",
      "浪费了献给梦魔的体液。",
      "股间散发出强烈的气味。就这样走到外面的话，会被梦魔发现吗？",
      "同伴顺利地增加，据点也得到了相当的扩张。收集物资回到据点的话，软绵绵的床铺、穿着猥亵的服装，有着你所喜欢的身材的*同伴*们在等着你。那么，今晚的侍寝对象该选谁呢...看来刚才是在做梦，继续做梦吧。"
    ]
  }
]
